{"id":1506,"date":"2015-07-27T06:09:09","date_gmt":"2015-07-27T13:09:09","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/?p=1506"},"modified":"2018-08-15T07:22:11","modified_gmt":"2018-08-15T07:22:11","slug":"the-july-27-2015-roster-has-been-posted-with-pictures-from-the-breakfast","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2015\/07\/27\/the-july-27-2015-roster-has-been-posted-with-pictures-from-the-breakfast\/","title":{"rendered":"The July 27, 2015 Roster has been posted with pictures from the July breakfast!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>The July 27th CCRA Roster has been posted and can be found below.<\/p>\n<p>150727 CCRA Roster<\/p>\n<p>Here&#8217;s what&#8217;s happening&#8230;<\/p>\n<p>Our newest member is Bill Fenech, AI6JZ is from San Ramon. He wasn&#8217;t able to make the breakfast but will try to do so at the August breakfast. He is a long-time ham who is getting reactivated so when you hear him please welcome him to the group.<\/p>\n<p>Glen Rickerd, NO6W of Pittsburg is on the mend after an illness. We wish him a speedy recovery.<\/p>\n<p>One of the biggest surprises of the meeting was a letter and donation from the East Bay Amateur Radio Club for the use of the repeater system in their support of the Grizzley Peak Century ride on May 3rd of this year.\u00a0 Randy Jenkins, KA6BQF who is the Treasurer of EBARC made the presentation during the breakfast.\u00a0 All of us are very appreciative of the support from the\u00a0 EBARC and the Grizzley Peak Cyclists.\u00a0 We are very pleased that the repeater was of use to them in their public service activity and we look forward to working with them in the future!<\/p>\n<p>The CCRA is gratified to have so many wonderful members and look forward to seeing everyone at our next breakfast on August 22nd at Legends &amp; Heroes Sports Bar at 9 AM. Legends is located at at the Diablo Creek Golf Course at 4050 Port Chicago Highway in North Concord.<\/p>\n<div id=\"attachment_345319\" style=\"width: 610px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-345319\" data-attachment-id=\"345319\" data-permalink=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2015\/07\/27\/the-july-27-2015-roster-has-been-posted-with-pictures-from-the-breakfast\/2015-07-25-09-21-30\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/ccra.us\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-07-25-09.21.30.jpg?fit=4128%2C2322\" data-orig-size=\"4128,2322\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;2.2&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;SM-N900T&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;1437816090&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;4.13&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"2015-07-25-09.21.30\" data-image-description=\"&lt;p&gt;Looking over the shoulder of Vicki, N6KLS as she leads the July 25, 2015 CCRA meeting.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\" data-image-caption=\"&lt;p&gt;Looking over the shoulder of Vicki, N6KLS as she leads the July 25, 2015 CCRA meeting.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\" data-medium-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/ccra.us\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-07-25-09.21.30.jpg?fit=300%2C169\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/ccra.us\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-07-25-09.21.30.jpg?fit=600%2C338\" class=\"size-large wp-image-345319\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/ccra.us\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-07-25-09.21.30.jpg?resize=600%2C338\" alt=\"Looking over the shoulder of Vicki, N6KLS as she leads the July 25, 2015 CCRA meeting.\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/ccra.us\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-07-25-09.21.30.jpg?resize=1024%2C576 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/ccra.us\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-07-25-09.21.30.jpg?resize=300%2C169 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/ccra.us\/wp-c